Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像是一个巨大的闪光灯\N{\rEng}It's like a giant strobe light...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,烧穿了我的双眼\N{\rEng}burning right through my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知道为什么我还能看得见\N{\rEng}Somehow I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们像烧焦的纸片\N{\rEng}Children look like burnt paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,黑漆漆的\N{\rEng}black...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一动不动\N{\rEng}not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,接着爆炸产生的冲击波击中他们\N{\rEng}And then the blast wave hits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就像树叶一样四处飞散\N{\rEng}And they fly apart like leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,关于世界末日的梦是很常见的\N{\rEng}Dreams of the end of the world are very common.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不是梦  蠢货  是真实的场景\N{\rEng}It's not a dream, you moron. It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道发生的日期\N{\rEng}I know the date it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你的感受确实很真实\N{\rEng}I'm sure it feels very real to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,1997年8月29日\N{\rEng}On August 29th, 1997,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈也会觉得非常真实的\N{\rEng}it's gonna feel pretty fuckin' real to you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要是没涂两百万的防晒霜\N{\rEng}Anybody not wearing two million
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那天都会惨不忍睹\N{\rEng}sunblock is gonna have a real bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-明白吗  -莎拉\N{\rEng}- Get it? - Sarah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  你觉得自己活得很安全吗\N{\rEng}God, you think you're safe and alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们已经死了  所有人\N{\rEng}You're already dead. Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他  你  你们都死了\N{\rEng}Him, you! You're dead already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方  全都不存在了\N{\rEng}This whole place, everything you see is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈才是活在梦里\N{\rEng}You're the one living in a fucking dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道这事确实发生过  发生过\N{\rEng}'Cause I know it happened! It happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有这样一个未来\N{\rEng}There once was a future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,人类被会思考的机器\N{\rEng}in which humankind was hunted...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,以及为杀戮而生的终结者\N{\rEng}by a machine that could think...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,追捕猎杀\N{\rEng}and Terminators built to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一个毫无希望的未来\N{\rEng}A future without hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(0,200)\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\pos(30.6,227.2)\c&HEBF4F8&}危地马拉利文斯顿  1998年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但那种未来没有发生  因为我阻止了它\N{\rEng}That future never happened because I stopped it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护我的儿子\N{\rEng}to protect my son...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也为了拯救人类\N{\rEng}and to save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
