Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos(275.4,184.8)}目标匹配\N编号342-589\N任务资料\N康纳  约翰\N身高  42856  55378\N体重  55867  63489\N头发  20002  85612\N眼睛  38468  01254\N性别  78133  76287\N面部
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs18\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos(202.2,249.6)}目标已终结
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经拯救了三十亿生命\N{\rEng}Once I saved three billion lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\rEng}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但却救不了我的儿子\N{\rEng}but I couldn't save my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\rEng}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一个机器从我身边夺走了他\N{\rEng}A machine took him from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也终结了我\N{\rEng}And I am terminated.
