Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,242)\shad1\bord0}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,242)\shad1\bord0}站住别动
