Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,242)\shad1\bord0}我们都不认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  好了  好了\N{\rEng}Okay, okay, okay.
