Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,242)\shad1\bord0}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,242)\shad1\bord0}太厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  女士\N{\rEng}Thanks, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才救了我们\N{\rEng}You just saved our asses.
